	"nodes":[
		{"id":"UIHeader","type":"text","x":-732,"y":-424,"width":1000,"height":320,"text":"# Two-variable arithmetic-geometric mean inequality\n\n**Assumptions**\n\n- $a,b$ are nonnegative real numbers.\n\n**Statement / basic definitions**\n\n$$\n\\forall a,b\\in[0,\\infty),\\quad\\frac{a+b}{2}\\ge\\sqrt{ab}\n$$\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/index|Overview and background]] · Proved (mathematical conclusion)"},
		{
			"id":"A1",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-432,
			"y":16,
			"width":400,
			"height":296,
			"text":"| A1 | ASSUMPTION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Nonnegative inputs\n\n$$\na,b\\in[0,\\infty)\n$$\n\nAssume $a,b\\ge0$.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/A1|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/A1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/A1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
			"dynamicHeight":false,
			"styleAttributes":{"proofRole":"ASSUMPTION","proofResult":"false","shape":"rectangle","textAlign":"left","border":"solid","proofColorRole":"given","proofPaletteDefault":"true"},
			"color":"#88BBDD"
		},
		{
			"id":"K1",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-896,
			"y":0,
			"width":400,
			"height":312,
			"text":"| K1 | KNOWN_RESULT |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Square nonnegativity\n\n$$\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R,\\quad t^2\\ge0\n$$\n\nEvery real square is nonnegative.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/K1|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/K1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/K1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
			"dynamicHeight":false,
			"styleAttributes":{"proofRole":"KNOWN_RESULT","proofResult":"false","shape":"rectangle","textAlign":"left","border":"solid","proofColorRole":"external","proofPaletteDefault":"true"},
			"color":"#B39DDB"
		},
		{
			"id":"C1",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-554,
			"y":472,
			"width":180,
			"height":180,
			"text":"**C1**\n\nCOMBINE\n\nMerge\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/C1|Details]]",
			"dynamicHeight":false,
			"styleAttributes":{"proofRole":"COMBINE","proofResult":"false","shape":"circle","textAlign":"center","border":"solid","proofColorRole":"combine","proofPaletteDefault":"true"},
			"color":"#E5C85B"
		},
		{
			"id":"R1",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-664,
			"y":812,
			"width":400,
			"height":344,
			"text":"| R1 | BOUND |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Squared comparison\n\n$$\n(a+b)^2\\ge 4ab\n$$\n\nThe squared arithmetic sum bounds the product.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/R1|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/R1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/R1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
			"dynamicHeight":false,
			"styleAttributes":{"proofRole":"BOUND","proofResult":"true","shape":"rectangle","textAlign":"left","border":"solid","proofColorRole":"result","proofPaletteDefault":"true"},
			"color":"#CFE8CC"
		},
		{
			"id":"K2",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-200,
			"y":812,
			"width":400,
			"height":424,
			"text":"| K2 | KNOWN_RESULT |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Square-root monotonicity\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\forall u,v\\in[0,\\infty),\\\\&\\quad u\\le v\\\\&\\qquad\\Rightarrow\\sqrt u\\le\\sqrt v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSquare roots preserve order on nonnegative reals.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/K2|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/K2#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/K2#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
			"dynamicHeight":false,
			"styleAttributes":{"proofRole":"KNOWN_RESULT","proofResult":"false","shape":"rectangle","textAlign":"left","border":"solid","proofColorRole":"external","proofPaletteDefault":"true"},
			"color":"#B39DDB"
		},
		{
			"id":"C2",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-322,
			"y":1396,
			"width":180,
			"height":180,
			"text":"**C2**\n\nCOMBINE\n\nMerge\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/C2|Details]]",
			"dynamicHeight":false,
			"styleAttributes":{"proofRole":"COMBINE","proofResult":"false","shape":"circle","textAlign":"center","border":"solid","proofColorRole":"combine","proofPaletteDefault":"true"},
			"color":"#E5C85B"
		},
		{
			"id":"T1",
			"type":"text",
			"x":-432,
			"y":1736,
			"width":400,
			"height":344,
			"text":"| T1 | TARGET |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Arithmetic-geometric mean\n\n$$\n\\frac{a+b}{2}\\ge\\sqrt{ab}\n$$\n\nThe arithmetic mean is at least the geometric mean.\n\n---\n\n[[note/two-variable-am-gm/T1|Details]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/T1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/two-variable-am-gm/T1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
			"dynamicHeight":false,
			"styleAttributes":{"proofRole":"TARGET","proofResult":"false","shape":"rectangle","textAlign":"left","border":"solid","proofColorRole":"target","proofPaletteDefault":"true"},
			"color":"#E69A9A"
		}
	],
